      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Highlights",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Magnesium in the form worth taking. Glycinate is chelated to the amino acid glycine, which makes it well absorbed and far gentler on the stomach than the cheap oxide form found in most supplements. Magnesium contributes to normal muscle function, normal psychological function and the reduction of tiredness and fatigue — which is why most people reach for it in the evening.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Take two capsules daily with water, ideally 30 to 60 minutes before bed. Can be taken with or without food. Do not exceed the recommended daily dose. Food supplements should not be used as a substitute for a varied, balanced diet and healthy lifestyle. If you are pregnant, breastfeeding or taking medication, speak to your doctor first.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's Inside",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>375mg Elemental Magnesium</strong> — 100% of the EU daily reference intake, as magnesium bisglycinate.<br/><strong>Glycine</strong> — the amino acid carrier that makes it well absorbed.<br/><strong>Vegan capsule shell</strong> — plant cellulose, no gelatin.</p><p>No magnesium oxide, no fillers, no artificial colours.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
